 "segments": [
  {
   "text": "Okay chat, we are finally inside the bank and nobody has noticed us yet.",
   "start_s": 0.0,
   "end_s": 5.8
  },
  {
   "text": "Wait, wait, why is the alarm already going off? I did not touch anything.",
   "start_s": 6.2,
   "end_s": 12.0
  },
  {
   "text": "Do you think the guard saw the car? Because I parked it on the sidewalk like an idiot.",
   "start_s": 12.4,
   "end_s": 18.6
  },
  {
   "text": "Yeah, he definitely saw the car. Okay, new plan, we go out through the roof.",
   "start_s": 19.0,
   "end_s": 24.8
  },
  {
   "text": "Is there even a ladder up here? No? Great. Amazing. Love this for us.",
   "start_s": 25.2,
   "end_s": 31.4
  },
  {
   "text": "Hold on, there is a helicopter on the next building and I think the door is open.",
   "start_s": 31.8,
   "end_s": 38.0
  },
  {
   "text": "How far can you jump in this game? Let's find out, live, with everybody watching.",
   "start_s": 38.4,
   "end_s": 44.6
  },
  {
   "text": "I made it! I actually made it! Clip that, somebody clip that right now.",
   "start_s": 45.0,
   "end_s": 50.8
  },
  {
   "text": "Okay, I have never flown one of these before, so what is the worst that could happen?",
   "start_s": 51.2,
   "end_s": 57.4
  },
  {
   "text": "The worst that could happen is apparently flying straight into a billboard.",
   "start_s": 57.8,
   "end_s": 63.6
  },
  {
   "text": "Why does the billboard have my face on it? Who made this? Was it you guys?",
   "start_s": 64.0,
   "end_s": 70.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Somebody in chat paid for a billboard of me just to make me crash. That is commitment.",
   "start_s": 70.6,
   "end_s": 76.4
  },
  {
   "text": "Alright, we are alive, the money is gone, and the police are very, very close.",
   "start_s": 76.8,
   "end_s": 82.6
  },
  {
   "text": "Honestly, best heist we have ever done. Same time tomorrow? Same time tomorrow.",
   "start_s": 83.0,
   "end_s": 89.6
  }
 ],
